[Trigger]
Name	rising
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Goldspire stands over the plateau like a coin on its edge, master. Treasurer Alaric Penn counts the kingdom's tax in its core and soldiers pour out of its gates day and night.
Action	objective	1	Kill Treasurer Alaric Penn in the core of the spire.
Action	objective	1	Dig gold and build a force of your own, the quarry is poor.
Action	objective	1	Take the low town below the spire.
Action	portal	1	off
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	firstCoin
Mode	once
Cond	mined	1	>=	500
Action	message	1	The first coin is in the vault and your portal draws creatures again. Rooms for them are within reach now.
Action	portal	1	on
Action	setflag	portalOn	1
Action	gold	1	400
Action	spawn	1	21	73	1	Orc:2	Goblin:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	roadWalked
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Road
Action	message	1	The road to the spire. The treasurer has spies on the low town, so move quickly.
Action	reveal	1	LowTown
Action	reveal	1	Yard
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	lowTown
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	LowTown	40
Action	message	1	The low town is yours. The spire has taken notice and the first of the soldiers have been woken.
Action	setflag	southHeld	1
Action	reveal	1	SouthGate
Action	reveal	1	OuterRing
Action	objective	1	Wait for the south gate to open, then break through onto the outer ring.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	yardSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Yard
Action	message	1	A gold yard in the south-east that the garrison forgot. Take what you can carry.
Action	gold	1	700
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	gateOpen
Mode	once
Cond	flag	southHeld	1
Cond	region	1	SouthGate
Action	message	1	The south gate stands over you. The garrison will empty onto the ring the moment you enter.
Action	setflag	treasurerAlert	1
Action	spawn	3	47	51	1	Knight:3	Elf:3	Monk:3	Adventurer:2
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	onRing
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	OuterRing
Action	message	1	You are on the outer ring. Four wings branch off it, and each holds a vault. The east and west links are walled up and open when the inner ring falls.
Action	reveal	1	WestWing
Action	reveal	1	NorthWing
Action	reveal	1	NorthEastWing
Action	reveal	1	EastWing
Action	reveal	1	MidRing
Action	reveal	1	Ledge
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	wingSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	WestWing
Action	message	1	The west vault is full and badly guarded. A strong box is worth a hundred soldiers.
Action	gold	1	500
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	northEastSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	NorthEastWing
Action	message	1	The north-east wing is the barracks of the heavy guard, and it will not stay quiet.
Action	spawn	3	65	19	1	Knight:3	Knight:3	Dwarf2:3	Monk:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	midRing
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	MidRing
Action	message	1	The inner ring. Lightning hangs in the air, and the core is only a few steps away.
Action	reveal	1	Core
Action	setflag	ringsBroken	1
Action	spawn	3	66	23	1	Knight:4	Elf:3	Monk:3	Dwarf2:3
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	coreSeen
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Core
Action	message	1	The core of the spire. The treasurer is at his table, and his guards are rising.
Action	objective	1	Strike down Alaric Penn.
[/Trigger]
